# Every change needs the owner's review. The paths below are listed separately so that, when a
# second maintainer exists, the controls that protect the record keep a named owner.
*                   @ogbetspp-coder

# Who can change production, what the record is encrypted with, and what CI enforces.
/infra/             @ogbetspp-coder
/scripts/gcp/       @ogbetspp-coder
/.github/           @ogbetspp-coder
/contracts/         @ogbetspp-coder
/fhir/              @ogbetspp-coder
/LICENSE            @ogbetspp-coder

# What builds and checks the images and the pins (audit B07): the gates' readers and scanners, the
# Dockerfiles and the Cloud Build configuration. Their rules are denylists; review is the control.
/scripts/ci/        @ogbetspp-coder
/Dockerfile*        @ogbetspp-coder
/cloudbuild*.yaml   @ogbetspp-coder
/SECURITY.md        @ogbetspp-coder
